_type: Concept
title: 'Wildcard pattern rocq'
journey: fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/index.td")
status: 'learning'
---

A ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/pattern.td")} (usually written `_`) that matches any value without binding it to a name, useful for ignoring irrelevant cases in ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/pattern-matching.td")}.
